Scope of this file
------------------
The MIT licence below covers the code in this repository: all *.py and *.sh
files, in every subdirectory.

All PAPER.md, PAPER.cs.md, README.md and README.cs.md files are licensed
CC BY 4.0 (https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/), not MIT.

Two files come from elsewhere and keep their own terms:
  hospv-eval/data/ASTMG173.csv   NREL's tabulation of ASTM G173-03 as
                                 distributed with pvlib, BSD 3-clause; see
                                 hospv-eval/data/README.md
  xternary-eval/vendor/          upstream code, see
                                 xternary-eval/vendor/LICENSE.xt_quant

The evaluated preprints are the work of their own author and are not included
here; they are open access under CC BY 4.0 at the DOIs given in README.md.

